- item: skirt, quantity 1; requirements: none beyond the kind of product
- budget: at most 317 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- rule from the request: Item must be on hand in stock, not just an online listing.
- rule from the request: Total spend must not exceed 475 cents.
- rule from the request: Do not suggest substitutes if nothing fits; just say so.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 3 messages.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 steps; no extra moves.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item

